From: nsbradley88 <3960699+nsbradley88@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:05:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/46] speculative: MTP draft-vocabulary subset
 (--spec-draft-vocab) for qwen35 / qwen35moe

Port of the GLM series patch 0017 to the Qwen3.5-family MTP draft head. llama_set_draft_vocab() gathers
the subset rows of the draft model's output head into a separate buffer; build_mtp_head() computes only
those rows and scatters them back to the full vocabulary (get_rows by an inverse map, -inf outside the
subset). The target verification is unchanged, so the output stays exact; only drafts of out-of-subset
tokens are lost. --spec-draft-vocab FILE takes little-endian int32 token ids.

Qwen3.8-27B (MTP Q3_K head, 248320 x 5120): draft step 4.21 -> 2.30 ms with a 32K subset (Strix Halo, Vulkan).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
